{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_020_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2860037e401be47e211d04bb7b0c598cf5ffd31335cd57296c510339da6798c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4dfe7e97f80b21f6220f3a5726c6a59ad7ec18af40d869729bae416175b2d17",
      "text": "早上好。\n还有，祝你生日快乐，隼人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9503c93f44351b4566b6181b3b71966161f2b64ee62c047887312bf0541274ad",
      "text": "生日快乐秋山同学！要开心度过这一天哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3108721c4fe76a097ac0a53a573868e46b8c5af990fb6a7690e85f9c433e20fe",
      "text": "谢谢大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a574bd4bf45c43eeeee65f8b8567f438204f5ae74e28e18fcba2165e8eceaaa9",
      "text": "（没想到一大早\n就能得到大家的祝福啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfa79ec3535133fae054ac345fc216d440822abcef869debc6e6be6dbbf9e81a",
      "text": "哎？课桌里塞了什么东西。\n信封……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b187e24261e3fe9a154b1c12a0411700f7a00ec1a93cb1fcfabd03540501923",
      "text": "“今天放学后，事务所集合！”\n……这是四季的字迹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b482249dd3d6b3f86aef665a73dfd5d667f45fb2b4484ead6f3661535e642920",
      "text": "也就是说……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000091:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15646b13b9f99fca4055ea9f9c4e7c45f92d5400293db167ef0ac2ecf5690da",
      "text": "放学后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3209d39a908190fd7e5d4c68e5baa1a5ea93f09adeef6a37c06e05459b797d17",
      "text": "派对的邀请函我已经塞进\n隼人亲的课桌里了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0172e3e04a55476b4f17abe26b9d4e14ece4b121ec3c0838fd429a8f656fc481",
      "text": "接下来就只等本人过来了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50bee9a7c222b8d0cad2355bf3d1743e09f12e1664cbae48f737a5a0715a7fb6",
      "text": "是的！要彻底瞒住他，\n可费了Mega Mega大的功夫呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68372620c4fac7ee0e4b6762b01a81ecaf3595e39f588c51af33200fc1a09c38",
      "text": "是啊……一直在提心吊胆\n会不会穿帮……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15e8a83d036f0f884eb54a5e24cfafba1be0db8f0f8260f37b73d7bb6effa0da",
      "text": "噢，隼人来联络了。\n说马上就到事务所了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ac44840bbba3396ae470ced15b5070ddf8b4a9ce4d208b51104318f757e7bf0",
      "text": "了解。大家各就各位吧。\n●●●●プロデューサー也拜托了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1040a94dfb84b35cba145968ac4797fefa453b570ae1b8977b5a1e37b764ea03",
      "text": "好的，交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d9e8f01c4bba42f7a686c8cf5f547acf5288977353313fb2a312741973c06ad",
      "text": "大家都在吗……？\n啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000206:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab4b942e1dfcd016359bb1b4637730c4517d321ad026d9864f20b673406ed372",
      "text": "隼人，生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000224:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4446a05f2703d21314084ceaa8f3f1b167925aa11415a02379d6925bb0edd911",
      "text": "谢、谢谢……大家……！\n真的为我准备了这一切……呜呜……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000238:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d9a2d8fc6843c93e8774eea3a8a69adeac984ba2824dd898f7dc58822ae6e1f",
      "text": "别哭啦，隼人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000244:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2abd8f06d7e7d3b2b76b7b904b1e3f604f80f0ffb037c26ce589ce018a25230a",
      "text": "就是啊！不过竟然高兴到哭出来……\n惊喜大获成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000255:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b105d62fc9900f6ccd93267b268958e13de6d0d50fa407bbd03e90583012e002",
      "text": "……太好了呢，旬先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000259:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c312e4e6af68b62cc85c66c7537cc8bdedb97e7b117a7cec4a73592535bf07f0",
      "text": "嗯。能平安无事地办完真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000272:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35eec1fdcc561f28b43b01f7ef345f20e7a9eb0b9465e111c5eb355d1b0123d9",
      "text": "好啦，擦擦眼泪快到这边来。\n收下我们送你的礼物吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000287:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccfbf110c630fa0aa7c9e68a612f6b8034235dbb5eae4d3f74e897005c200f63",
      "text": "谢谢你们……！\n嘿嘿，真期待拆开它。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_e:cmd-000316:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33fffd73d35ece92627f0acce70b7ccde4fb56c0a082a908705a35bed112b031",
      "text": "今天多亏了大家，让我度过了最棒的生日。\n真的太谢谢你们了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
